sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant P as DBConnectionPoolManager
  participant F as free list
  participant U as in-use list
  C->>P: getDBConnection()
  P->>F: take a connection
  P->>U: add it
  P-->>C: connection
  C->>C: run queries
  C->>P: releaseDBConnection(conn)
  P->>U: remove it
  P->>F: add it back
